{
    "about": "The note type of a note (documentation/Canonical Form.md, section \"The note type of a note\"). Both implementations read every case. `read`: the paths of a question, the answer of the Starter Kit, and the note type that each path must get (a path that is not in `types` has no type). `refused`: the paths of a question and an answer that must stop the run. `manifest`: a value of the key `noteType` of a manifest entry, and whether the entry can be read. `asked`: the paths of a question and the paths that the Starter Kit is asked about.",
    "read": [
        {
            "name": "a note with a type and a note without one",
            "question": ["Garden/Tomato.md", "Welcome.md"],
            "answer": {
                "noteTypes": [
                    {
                        "name": "recipes",
                        "displayName": "Recipes",
                        "prefix": "",
                        "suffix": " (Recipe)",
                        "prefixOptional": false,
                        "suffixOptional": true
                    }
                ],
                "notes": [
                    {
                        "path": "Garden/Tomato.md",
                        "noteType": "recipes"
                    },
                    {
                        "path": "Welcome.md",
                        "noteType": null
                    }
                ]
            },
            "types": {
                "Garden/Tomato.md": {
                    "displayName": "Recipes",
                    "name": "recipes",
                    "suffix": " (Recipe)"
                }
            }
        },
